      "statement": "Template assignment to positions follows three priority mechanisms: (1) pinned positions always match their pinned template regardless of other rules; (2) unpinned positions match rules, with the most specific rule winning; (3) two equally specific matching rules create a clash, flagged for user resolution; excluded positions are removed from a template.",
